{"term":"卵巢","lang":"zh","script":"hans","romanization":"luǎncháo","category":"organs","subcategory":"ovaries","concept":"ovaries","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"clinical","crude":3,"technical":95,"recognition_pct_current":86,"recognition_pct_peak":86,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"The standard Mandarin clinical term for the ovaries, the paired female gonads producing ova and sex hormones.","english_term":"ovaries","english_translation_quality":"direct","notes":"Literally 'egg nest'; entirely clinical; widely recognized through health education and media coverage of ovarian cysts and polycystic ovary syndrome."}
